senses.gloss:
ध्वंस, अस्, m. falling down, perishing, destruc-
tion, demolition; vanishing, ceasing to exist, loss, ruin;
(ई), f. a mote in a sun-beam.

ध्वंसन, अस्, आ, अम्, causing to fall, destroying,
demolishing, ruining; scattering, dispersing; sprinkling;
(अम्), n. perishing, dying; loss, destruction, ruin;
falling; going.

ध्वजिन्, ई, इनी, इ, furnished with or bearing a
flag, carrying a flag or standard, hoisting an ensign;
(at end of comp.) having as a mark or sign; (ई), m.
a standard-bearer; one having an emblem or sign;
a distiller or vendor of spirituous liquors; a car,
chariot, carriage; a mountain; a snake; a peacock;
a horse; a Brāhman; (इनी), f. ‘a bannered host,’
an army.
—ध्वजिनी-पति, इस्, m. the leader of
an army.

ध्वस्मन्, आ, m., Ved. polluting, darkening;
(Sāy.) destroying, destructive; causing destruction.
—ध्वस्मन्-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, Ved. covered?;
(Sāy.) whose faults or imperfections are destroyed;
(अत्), n. (according to Yāska) water.

ध्वस्र, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. sprinkling, spattering;
scattering, liberal; (Sāy.) destructive; (अस्), m., N.
of a king.
